# ============================================================
#  STUDENT FILES — no direct web access (F1)
#
#  These are PSA birth certificates, health records and affidavits.
#  Apache was serving this directory straight to anyone who could guess
#  a filename. Names are <student_id>_<unixtime>_<original>, and both
#  halves are guessable, so an unauthenticated visitor could read a
#  student's records.
#
#  Files are now downloaded through api/file-download.php, which checks
#  the session, the role, and that the file belongs to the requesting
#  student before streaming a byte.
#
#  Script execution was already blocked below; this closes READ access,
#  which that guard never did.
#
#  Assets such as avatars (assets/uploads/students) and ID QR codes
#  (uploads/ids) are deliberately NOT blocked — they are rendered inline
#  in <img> tags and must stay fetchable.
# ============================================================
Require all denied
